  "title": "Syria: TotalEnergies signs a Cooperation Agreement on Offshore Exploration",
  "summary": "Paris, May 12, 2026 – TotalEnergies together with its partners QatarEnergy and ConocoPhillips, has signed today a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with the Syrian Petroleum Company (SPC) relating to the exploration of Block 3, offshore Syria in the Mediterranean Sea. The MoU covers a technical review by the partners of the offshore Block 3 area […]",
